---
/**
 * /press/unum-partners-with-coriolis
 * UNUM x Coriolis release (Brandy draft; Paul 2026-11-04 9:49 AM ET via Chief).
 * Hidden: `hidden: true` in PRESS_POSTS keeps it off /press; off the sitemap
 * (astro.config.mjs filter + gen-lastmod SKIP). Indexable, like the existing release.
 * Same layout and hero placement as press/[slug].astro.
 */
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CtaRow from "../../components/CtaRow.astro";
import { LINKS, linkClass } from "../../lib/links";
import { pressBySlug } from "../../lib/press";
import { SITE, SITE_ORIGIN } from "../../lib/site";
import { withBase } from "../../lib/base";

const post = pressBySlug("unum-partners-with-coriolis")!;
const siteOrigin = Astro.site ?? new URL(SITE_ORIGIN);
const pageUrl = new URL(withBase(post.path), siteOrigin).href;
const imageUrl = new URL(withBase(post.ogImagePath), siteOrigin).href;
const ext = { target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer" };
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${post.title} | Coriolis Agency`}
  description={post.dek}
  path={post.path}
  ogImagePath={post.ogImagePath}
  ogType="article"
  publishedTime={post.date}
  extraJsonLd={[
    {
      "@type": "NewsArticle",
      "@id": `${pageUrl}#article`,
      headline: post.title,
      description: post.dek,
      datePublished: post.date,
      dateModified: post.date,
      url: pageUrl,
      image: imageUrl,
      inLanguage: "en-US",
      author: { "@type": "Organization", name: SITE.legalName, url: LINKS.home },
      publisher: { "@id": `${LINKS.home}/#organization` },
      isPartOf: { "@id": `${pageUrl}#webpage` },
    },
  ]}
>
  <article class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
        <a href={withBase("press")} class="hover:text-sky-300">Press</a>
        <span class="px-1.5">/</span>
        Release
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">
        For immediate release
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl text-balance">
        {post.title}
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-zinc-500">
        {post.location}, {post.dateLabel}
      </p>

      <figure class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10">
        <img
          src={withBase(post.ogImagePath)}
          alt={post.imageAlt}
          width="1283"
          height="965"
          class="w-full bg-[#111] object-contain"
        />
      </figure>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        <p>
          UNUM, the ammunition distribution platform that connects independent
          ammunition sellers and online retailers through a centralized catalog
          and fulfillment model, today announced a partnership with Coriolis
          Agency, the firearms industry's managed WooCommerce provider. UNUM
          retailers can now get a fully managed online store from{" "}
          <a href={withBase("unum")} class={linkClass}>Coriolis</a>: built on
          the retailer's own domain, run by Coriolis, and owned by the retailer.
        </p>
        <p>
          UNUM chose Coriolis for four reasons: experience, technology, included
          services, and innovation.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-white">Experience.</strong> Coriolis is led by
          Paul Angell, Founder and CEO, the former Founder and CEO of
          AmmoReady.com, and Joel Hobgood, Director of Operations at Coriolis and
          former Director of Operations at AmmoReady. Between them they have
          spent years building and running online stores for ammunition and
          firearms retailers.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-white">Technology.</strong> Coriolis stores run on
          WooCommerce, with FFL Cockpit distributor catalogs and automated
          dropshipping, FFL Checkout, and GunSearchEngine.com demand data built in.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-white">Included services.</strong> Coriolis handles
          site maintenance, including WordPress and plugin updates and backups;
          uptime monitoring; security with Cloudflare protection; and
          availability on WP Engine premium hosting with a 99.95% uptime SLA.
          Analytics monitoring and managed email automation, including welcome,
          back in stock, browse abandonment and abandoned cart flows, are part of
          the service.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-white">Innovation.</strong> Coriolis builds its own
          software in its AI Studio, using CodeFab, the Coriolis software
          factory. Examples include{" "}
          <a href="https://www.botopticon.com" class={linkClass} {...ext}>Botopticon</a>,{" "}
          <a href="https://www.gunstoregame.com" class={linkClass} {...ext}>GunStoreGame</a>{" "}
          and{" "}
          <a href="https://www.gunsearchengine.com" class={linkClass} {...ext}>GunSearchEngine</a>.
          The same studio will keep building the tools that support UNUM's
          growth.
        </p>

        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-gold/60 pl-4 text-zinc-200">
          <p>
            "Ammo retailers should spend their day moving ammo, not fixing
            plugins," said Paul Angell, Founder and CEO of Coriolis Agency.
            "UNUM gives them the catalog. We build the store, we run it, and we
            answer when something breaks. They own it."
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>
          Online ammunition retailers who want a fully managed store can learn
          more at{" "}
          <a href={LINKS.home} class={linkClass}>CoriolisAgency.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white">About Coriolis Agency</h2>
        <p>
          Coriolis Agency (Coriolis, LLC) builds, hosts, and supports WooCommerce
          websites for FFLs, gun stores, shooting ranges, and firearms brands.
          Founded by Paul Angell, who built and ran AmmoReady.com for nine years,
          the company delivers managed hosting, automated firearms dropshipping
          through FFL Cockpit, and demand tools including GunSearchEngine.com.
          Merchants own their sites. There is no long-term contract. Visit{" "}
          <a href={LINKS.home} class={linkClass}>CoriolisAgency.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white">About UNUM</h2>
        <p>
          UNUM connects independent ammunition sellers and online retailers
          through a centralized catalog and fulfillment model. Sellers invest.
          UNUM fulfills. Retailers sell. Learn more at{" "}
          <a href="https://unumnow.com" class={linkClass} {...ext}>unumnow.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <CtaRow primary="contact" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
